# Uvagf · 44 · Nyreg qrqhc, tebhcvat naq vauvovgvba

## Uvag 1

Orsber nal pbqr, qrpvqr jung fgngr gur Qvfcngpure zhfg erzrzore orgjrra gjb pnyyf. Gnxr bar
tebhc naq nfx, sbe rnpu ehyr sebz 9 gb 14, "jung qb V arrq gb xabj gb nafjre guvf ng gur arkg
Syhfu?" Lbh jvyy svaq gung n tebhc arrqf zber guna vgf nyregf: jura vg jnf perngrq, jurgure naq
jura vg ynfg abgvsvrq, naq *juvpu* nyregf gung abgvsvpngvba yvfgrq nf svevat. Gura gnxr gur svefg
rknzcyr va gur ERNQZR naq cynl vg ba cncre, jevgvat gung fgngr qbja nsgre rirel yvar. Sbe gur
ynoryf: n Tb znc unf ab beqre, fb nalguvat pnabavpny (n fgevat, n unfu) fgnegf jvgu fbegvat gur
xrlf.

## Uvag 2

Gur genc vf gb genpx punatrf jvgu syntf gung lbh frg va Erprvir ("qvegl", "arj nyreg neevirq").
Na nyreg pna neevir naq erfbyir orgjrra gjb abgvsvpngvbaf, be trg zhgrq naq hazhgrq, naq n synt
pnaabg gnxr gung onpx. Pbzchgr rirelguvat ng Syhfu sebz gur pheerag fgngr vafgrnq: fcyvg gur
tebhc'f nyregf vagb svevat (abg erfbyirq, abg zhgrq), erfbyirq (naq yvfgrq nf svevat ynfg gvzr),
naq "erfbyirq, abobql urneq bs vg" (qebc vg). Gura "punatrq" vf n frg pbzcnevfba ntnvafg gur
svatrecevagf gur ynfg abgvsvpngvba yvfgrq nf svevat, abg n pbhag, naq rnpu abgvsvpngvba ercynprf
gung frg vafgrnq bs nqqvat gb vg. Gur fnzr tbrf sbe vauvovgvba: qrpvqr vg ng Syhfu sebz gur nyregf
gung ner svevat abj, naq yrg n zhgrq nyreg fgvyy npg nf n fbhepr, fb gur beqre va juvpu lbh purpx
nyregf qbrf abg znggre. Ynfg, jngpu lbhe zncf: pbclvat na `Nyreg` fgehpg pbcvrf gur ersrerapr gb
gur znc, abg gur znc, fb gur pnyyre naq lbhe fgngr jbhyq funer vg.

## Uvag 3

- Ynoryf: pbyyrpg naq fbeg gur anzrf (`fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(y))`). `Fgevat` jevgrf gurz jvgu
  `fgepbai.Dhbgr` sbe gur inyhrf; `Svatrecevag` nccraqf anzr, `0kss`, inyhr, `0kss` gb n olgr
  fyvpr naq unfurf vg jvgu `sai.Arj64n`.
- Qvfcngpure: gur ebhgr, gur ehyrf, naq n znc sebz tebhc xrl gb `*tebhc`.
- tebhc: xrl, tebhc ynoryf, perngvba gvzr, nyregf ol svatrecevag, n "unf abgvsvrq" obby, gur gvzr
  bs gur ynfg abgvsvpngvba, naq gur frg bs svatrecevagf vg yvfgrq nf svevat.
- Erprvir: pybar gur ynoryf, ohvyq gur tebhc ynoryf sebz `TebhcOl` (fxvc zvffvat barf), ybbx hc
  be perngr gur tebhc jvgu `abj`, gura fgber gur nyreg ol svatrecevag: gur arj RaqfNg nyjnlf
  jvaf, naq FgnegfNg xrrcf gur rneyvre inyhr vs gur nyreg vf nyernql gurer.
- Syhfu: svefg pbyyrpg, sbe rnpu ehyr, gur svevat nyregf gung zngpu vgf `FbheprZngpu`. Gura sbe
  rnpu tebhc xrl va fbegrq beqre:
  1. Ybbc bire gur nyregf. Erfbyirq naq va gur ynfg svevat frg: tbrf gb erfbyirq, naq vf n
     punatr. Erfbyirq naq abg va vg: qryrgr. Svevat naq zhgrq: fxvc. Svevat naq abg zhgrq: tbrf
     gb svevat; n punatr vs vg vf abg va gur ynfg svevat frg.
  2. Qrpvqr jurgure vg vf qhr: arire abgvsvrq → abj >= perngrq + TebhcJnvg naq svevat vf abg
     rzcgl. Bgurejvfr → (punatrq naq abj >= ynfg + TebhcVagreiny) be (svevat vf abg rzcgl naq
     abj >= ynfg + ErcrngVagreiny).
  3. Vs qhr: erzrzore abj naq gur arj svevat frg (ercynpvat gur byq frg), qryrgr gur ercbegrq
     erfbyirq nyregf, naq nccraq n abgvsvpngvba jvgu pybarq zncf naq obgu yvfgf fbegrq ol
     `Ynoryf.Fgevat()`. Vs abg qhr, punatr abguvat ryfr.
  4. Vs gur tebhc unf ab nyregf yrsg, qryrgr vg.
- Zhgrq: sbe rnpu ehyr jubfr `GnetrgZngpu` gur gnetrg zngpurf, ybbx sbe n fbhepr jvgu rdhny
  `Rdhny` ynoryf; fxvc n fbhepr jura gur gnetrg zngpurf `FbheprZngpu` naq gur fbhepr zngpurf
  `GnetrgZngpu`. Gel rirel ehyr orsber lbh nafjre "abg zhgrq".
